<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ANAMINT HIKES HALF-YEAR DIVIDEND 29 PCT.</title>
<headline>ANAMINT HIKES HALF-YEAR DIVIDEND 29 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended September 30</p>
<p>(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     129	   vs 100</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 129	   vs 100  </p>
<p>    Attrib income	   129	   vs 100</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   130	   vs 101</p>
<p>    Tax			   1	   vs   1</p>
<p>    Investment income     133	   vs 105</p>
<p>    Share of associates'  622	   vs 405</p>
<p>    Total net earnings    751	   vs 505 </p>
