<p>De Beers/Centenary linked units, representing holdings of 25.8</p>
<p>percent and 23.4 percent respectively in De Beers Consolidated</p>
<p>Mines Ltd and Beers Centenary AG.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
